deepin-liferaft (0.1.0gxde2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Start through a gxde-k9 edging task instead of the systemd user service,
    which could fail to start in some graphical sessions.
  * Drop the systemd user unit and migrate its global enable links in postinst.
  * Fall back to recursive cgroup.procs enumeration and pidfd-backed SIGKILL
    when the kernel does not provide cgroup.kill.

